  "text": "Ascent locked. All seventeen captives are aboard. The lift is clear of sub-level six. Their breathing is settling. Easy now. You are safe. No one is putting you back in those pods. The voices in the network are fading. The forced link is broken. Their minds belong to them again. Pressure is venting into the geothermal sinks. The walls held. Downtown core is still standing. I pulled the vault orders. Every pod, every transfer signed off by the Citadel. This goes all the way up. The surface corridor is clear. Medics and transit crews are waiting at the maintenance junction. Citadel command has spotted the breach. Their orbital defenses are turning toward the upper sectors. They buried living people down here. Today, the cyber grave is empty. Every captive comes home with us. Tend to the wounded. We rest for an hour, then take the fight to the spire. Axiom force ascend.",
